OL,3,GNEWSADramatic clifftop rescue of bride
OL,4,Aand groom-to-be
OL,5,
OL,6,FA couple who went for a beach walk
OL,7,Fshortly after getting engaged had to be
OL,8,Frescued by the Irish Coast Guard after
OL,9,Fan incoming tide trapped them against a
OL,10,Fcoastal cliff.
OL,12,FThe bride and groom-to-be were hauled
OL,13,Fapproximately 150m (490 ft) to the top
OL,14,Fof the cliff to safety because rescuers
OL,15,Fcould not reach them by boat or by
OL,16,Fhelicopter.
OL,18,FThe dramatic rescue took place during
OL,19,Fgale-force winds on Achill Island, off
OL,20,Fthe west coast of Ireland, on Monday
OL,21,Fafternoon.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
