OL,4,Aand groom-to-be
OL,5,
OL,6,FCoast Guard volunteer Peter McManamon,
OL,7,Fwho coordinated the operation, told BBC
OL,8,FNews NI: "They were two very lucky
OL,9,Fpeople."
